RQ('pe.1', 'read-4', 'What did Polydectes order Perseus to bring?', 'the head of Medusa', ['the golden fleece', 'a winged horse', 'the shield of Athena'], '“τὴν τῆς Μεδούσης κεφαλὴν φέρειν”.', P_PERSEUS);
